* Crypto hacks 2018
** Figures
*** CipherTrace: ~$950M stolen, ~$725M exit scams
*** SlowMist: ~$874M, nominal mints excluded
*** Group-IB: Lazarus ~$571M in 5 attacks (2017-2018)
** Exchanges
*** Coincheck ~$534M (NEM hot wallet)
*** BitGrail ~$170M (double withdrawals)
*** Zaif, Coinrail, Bithumb, Bancor
** Token contracts
*** BEC and SMT overflows (nominal)
*** EDU transferFrom, SpankChain reentrancy
*** Fomo3D: airdrop and block stuffing
** Chains and front ends
*** 51% attacks: Bitcoin Gold, Verge, ZenCash
*** MyEtherWallet BGP hijack, BlackWallet DNS
*** event-stream (Copay), StatCounter (Gate.io)
** EOS mainnet year
*** EOSBet, EOS Fomo3D, BetDice rollbacks
** Not counted
*** Frauds: BitConnect, Pincoin/iFan, MapleChange
*** Blockchain.info phishing (multi-year)
